description=v3.7.9: a bug-hunt and polish round. The background memory sweep runs its full pass once per session instead of re-stopping every suspended app on each screen-off; runtime resource overlays are never suspended or restricted by the system-app widening; the exit log says what it actually releases. Every option's title and description is rewritten in plain language, and the launcher icon is redrawn at launcher size instead of filling its tile. Suite: 594 checks, 0 failed.
